      "title": "Local-First Core Pipeline",
      "items": [
        "CameraX captures high-resolution bitmap frames from camera preview",
        "ExtractLocallyUseCase orchestrates on-device OCR and deterministic parsing",
        "Room SQLite database guarantees instant offline persistence (<350ms total)"
