      "title": "Vision & Extraction Engine",
      "items": [
        "ML Kit provides sub-300ms text and barcode recognition on physical device",
        "RapidOCR (NCNN) integrated as alternative offline engine behind TextExtractor",
        "Deterministic parser extracts expiry dates and titles without cloud dependency"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Cloud & External Integrations",
      "items": [
        "OpenFoodFacts API enriches scanned barcodes with human-readable product names",
